📦 Common AWS CLI Commands ✅ S3 – Simple Storage Service

bash Copy Edit

List buckets
aws s3 ls

Upload a file
aws s3 cp file.txt s3://my-bucket/

Sync local folder to S3
aws s3 sync ./local-folder s3://my-bucket/ ✅ EC2 – Virtual Servers

bash Copy Edit

List EC2 instances
aws ec2 describe-instances

Start an instance
aws ec2 start-instances --instance-ids i-0123456789abcdef0

Stop an instance
aws ec2 stop-instances --instance-ids i-0123456789abcdef0 ✅ IAM – Identity & Access Management

bash Copy Edit

List IAM users
aws iam list-users

Create a new user
aws iam create-user --user-name newuser ✅ VPC – Virtual Private Cloud

bash Copy Edit

List all VPCs
aws ec2 describe-vpcs

Create a VPC
aws ec2 create-vpc --cidr-block 10.0.0.0/16 ✅ CloudFormation – IaC Deployment

